rfc826.txt, rfc1122.txt, rfc5227.txt
    The texts of RFC 826 (An Ethernet Address Resolution Protocol), RFC 1122 (Requirements for Internet Hosts
    -- Communication Layers) and RFC 5227 (IPv4 Address Conflict Detection), downloaded from
    https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/ on 2026-10-26.
    License: the IETF Trust's Legal Provisions Relating to IETF Documents.
    Used: the packet format and the reception algorithm of RFC 826, the cache rules of RFC 1122 §2.3.2, and
    the probes, announcements and conflicts of RFC 5227.

The ARP packets of the Linux kernel are in ../ethernet/linux.txt (see ../ethernet/SOURCE).
